      "/course/8/pentatonic-boxes"
    ],
    "cells": [
      {
        "type": "section",
        "heading": "Position 2 on its own",
        "minutes": 3,
        "cells": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Press Play below to start the metronome. Play position 2 of A minor pentatonic up and back down, one note per beat, and notice where its ringed {{1}} notes sit. Keep going until the shape feels as familiar as position 1."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool",
            "tool": {
              "type": "backing-band",
              "bpm": 70,
              "key": "a",
              "parts": {
                "click": "on"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "tool",
            "tool": {
              "type": "scale-neck",
              "scale": "minor-pentatonic",
              "key": "a",
              "boxes": [
                2
              ],
              "highlight": [
                "1"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "section",
        "heading": "The crossing",
        "minutes": 4,
        "cells": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The neck below shows only the crossing from position 1 to position 2. Climb position 1 from the low {{1}}. On the G string, slide from {{4}} up to {{5}} and finish the climb in position 2. Come back down the same way, sliding from {{5}} to {{4}}."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool",
            "tool": {
              "type": "position-neck",
              "scale": "minor-pentatonic",
              "key": "a",
              "cross": {
                "from": 1,
                "to": 2
              },
              "highlight": [
                "1"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "section",
        "heading": "The same in G and C",
        "minutes": 3,
        "cells": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Play the same crossing in other keys. Use the Key selector below to change the key.\nWhen you change the key, the notes change but the slide on the G string is still {{4}} to {{5}}. Stay in each key until the slide lands without you looking for it."
          },
          {
            "type": "tool",
            "tool": {
              "type": "position-neck",
              "scale": "minor-pentatonic",
              "key": "a",
              "cross": {
                "from": 1,
                "to": 2
              },
              "highlight": [
                "1"
              ]
            }
          }
